The engine the `oci` container and task resources of the node run with:
`podman` or `docker`.

If not set, podman if the node has it, else docker, as in v2.

The resources of type `oci` are the ones of the engine, and say so as their
type: `container.podman` or `container.docker`. A node running both engines
keeps its `oci` resources on docker with `oci = docker`.
